<!DOCTYPE HTML>

<head>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ siteUrl('assets/app.css') }}">
    <title>'t Zwolse kunsthuis</title>
</head>
<body>
{% include 'UI-elements/nav-bar.twig' %}
<div class="m-4 mt-24 box-border flex w-auto flex-col-reverse gap-4 md:min-h-[calc(90vh-64px)] md:flex-row">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-0 xl:w-[30vw]">
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-start gap-0 border-4 border-t-4 border-black p-4 md:h-full md:w-[calc(50vw-32px)] md:border-l-4">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 [&>*]:m-0">
                <h1>Een feest waarbij velen sterven</h1>
                <h4>Gideon Eilert</h4>
            </div>
            <p>€200,-</p>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 [&>*]:m-0 flex-row">
                    <div class="flex h-[46px] cursor-pointer flex-col items-center overflow-hidden border-4 border-black px-4 py-2">
                        <p class="m-0">FOTO</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex h-[46px] cursor-pointer flex-col items-center overflow-hidden border-4 border-black px-4 py-2">
                        <p class="m-0">ABSTRACT</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p>20x30cm</p>
            </div>
            <p>De installatie Circuits van de Amsterdamse ontwerp-collectief Experimental Jetset is speciaal ontworpen voor de omloop bovenaan de historische trap van het museum. Circuits laat zien hoe informatie ooit letterlijk een fysieke vorm had: geluid, beeld en andere data werden opgeslagen op tastbare dragers.</p>
        </div>
        <button class="cursor-pointer border-0 bg-black p-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase text-white">Vraag aan</button>
        </div>
        <div class="relative w-full" data-product-carousel>
            <div class="relative flex aspect-square cursor-pointer justify-center overflow-hidden border-4 border-black p-4 md:aspect-auto md:self-stretch md:h-full md:px-20">
                <div class="flex basis-full gap-5 transition-transform duration-300" data-carousel-items>
                    <img class="box-border h-auto w-full flex-none object-contain" src="{{ siteUrl('assets/placeholder_image.jpg') }}" alt="" data-carousel-item>
                    <img class="box-border h-auto w-full flex-none object-contain" src="{{ siteUrl('assets/placeholder_image.jpg') }}" alt="" data-carousel-item>
                    <img class="box-border h-auto w-full flex-none object-contain" src="{{ siteUrl('assets/placeholder_image.jpg') }}" alt="" data-carousel-item>
                    <img class="box-border h-auto w-full flex-none object-contain" src="{{ siteUrl('assets/placeholder_image.jpg') }}" alt="" data-carousel-item>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between md:absolute md:inset-0 md:z-[500]">
                <button class="w-full border-4 border-black border-t-0 bg-white py-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-35 md:h-full md:w-16" data-carousel-prev type="button" aria-label="Vorige foto">
                    <img src="{{ siteUrl('assets/chevron-left.svg') }}" alt="">
                </button>
                <button class="w-full border-4 border-black border-t-0 bg-white py-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-35 md:h-full md:w-16 border-l-0" data-carousel-next type="button" aria-label="Volgende foto">
                    <img src="{{ siteUrl('assets/chevron-right.svg') }}" alt="">
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
</div>
<script src="{{ siteUrl('assets/product-carousel.js') }}"></script>
{% include 'UI-elements/nieuws-block.twig' %}
{% include 'UI-elements/footer.twig' %}
<script src="{{ siteUrl('assets/nav-bar.js') }}"></script>
</body>